      "created_at": "2013-10-25T15:54:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the spirit of the Halloween week let me ask, of one of the greatest congregations of strong mind with little to do, which is scarier; a question with no answer or the answer to a question no one asked?  (PS I’m sitting bored at the waiting room of the DMV)</p>",
